# Assets\*.png and Assets\*.ico are generated by tools\new-icons.ps1 but are
# deliberately committed, not ignored. They are 65 KB for the whole set, and
# committing them is what makes a fresh clone build a package without first
# running a script — which nobody discovers they needed until packaging fails on
# a missing logo. The script stays for regenerating them after a palette change.

